# Project Overview

## Core Technologies

- **Framework**: Next.js 15.3.4 with TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 with @theme inline directive
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui (Radix UI primitives)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion 12.19.2
- **Forms**: React Hook Form with Zod validation
- **Color System**: OKLCH color space for cyberpunk theming
- **Theme**: next-themes (Safe Mode/Cyber Mode)
- **Fonts**: Rajdhani (headings), Geist Sans (body)

